    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "How can I show global keys in mini.clue?\r\n\r\nWhen using which-key.nvim I can go back (`<BS>`) all the way to the root:\r\n![116439871-df9ee480-a804-11eb-9529-800e167db65c](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/6123841/668ac3e0-67bf-4d42-9831-e3f6ee70e4ac)\r\n\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">How can I show global keys in mini.clue?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">When using which-key.nvim I can go back (<code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;BS&gt;</code>) all the way to the root:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6123841/300179393-668ac3e0-67bf-4d42-9831-e3f6ee70e4ac.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JixAApJp9keBp6SR2ChAcgq7HU5ZYzKBztbMq3vgzS8\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6123841/300179393-668ac3e0-67bf-4d42-9831-e3f6ee70e4ac.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JixAApJp9keBp6SR2ChAcgq7HU5ZYzKBztbMq3vgzS8\" alt=\"116439871-df9ee480-a804-11eb-9529-800e167db65c\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
    "bodyText": "How can I show global keys in mini.clue?\nWhen using which-key.nvim I can go back (<BS>) all the way to the root:",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
