    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "What do you mean by \"global keys\"? 'mini.clue' starts its key query process [strictly on opt-in triggers](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1cd8d7e8318071eddc536815f5cafe50b012ac29/doc/mini-clue.txt#L10) while [`<BS>` can also be used to remove previous entry](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1cd8d7e8318071eddc536815f5cafe50b012ac29/doc/mini-clue.txt#L191-L192). Pressing `<BS>` can remove all the until the initial trigger (if it is several keys, they are treated as single entry).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">What do you mean by \"global keys\"? 'mini.clue' starts its key query process <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1cd8d7e8318071eddc536815f5cafe50b012ac29/doc/mini-clue.txt#L10\">strictly on opt-in triggers</a> while <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1cd8d7e8318071eddc536815f5cafe50b012ac29/doc/mini-clue.txt#L191-L192\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;BS&gt;</code> can also be used to remove previous entry</a>. Pressing <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;BS&gt;</code> can remove all the until the initial trigger (if it is several keys, they are treated as single entry).</p>",
            "bodyText": "What do you mean by \"global keys\"? 'mini.clue' starts its key query process strictly on opt-in triggers while <BS> can also be used to remove previous entry. Pressing <BS> can remove all the until the initial trigger (if it is several keys, they are treated as single entry).",
